        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wayne Coyne, Toshiko Koshijima, Steven Drozd\n- Songs: The Golden Path\n- Bands: The Flaming Lips\n- Roles: musician, singer, lead vocals, backing vocals\n\nFacts:\n- Wayne Coyne was born on January 13, 1961, and he is an American musician.\n- Toshiko Koshijima was born on March 3, 1980, in Kanazawa, Ishikawa, and she is a Japanese singer.\n- The song \"The Golden Path\" featured The Flaming Lips.\n- In the song \"The Golden Path,\" Wayne Coyne performed the lead vocals.\n- In the song \"The Golden Path,\" Steven Drozd performed backing vocals.",
